{"id":"n71693-1-13","stage":1,"title":"이마 · 额","scene":"外貌评价","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71693-1-13-1","ko":"그 녀석 이마 한번 시원하게 생겼네.","zh":"那家伙的额头长得真够宽的啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那位、那个","explanation":"그：指前文或双方知道的那个人；与 녀석 合起来是“那家伙”。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"녀석","meaning":"家伙，小子","explanation":"녀석：家伙，小子。","readings":[{"term":"녀석","audio":"/audio/0e723d29b157aa0fccf9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41586","senseId":"2","lemma":"녀석","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"녀석","audio":"/audio/0e723d29b157aa0fccf9.mp3"}},{"text":"이마","meaning":"额，前额，额头","explanation":"이마：额，前额，额头。","readings":[{"term":"이마","audio":"/audio/772813c770d7cbf82ae4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71693","senseId":"1","lemma":"이마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이마","audio":"/audio/772813c770d7cbf82ae4.mp3"}},{"text":"한번","meaning":"真、确实","explanation":"한번 在这里加强对额头宽阔的感叹，不表示只发生一次。","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"1","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}},{"text":"시원하게","meaning":"宽阔舒展（这里形容额头）","explanation":"시원하다：宽阔舒展（这里形容额头）；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"3","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시원하게","audio":"/audio/112eefb30d9512024e22.mp3"}},{"text":"생겼네.","meaning":"长","explanation":"생기다：长；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"4","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생겼네","audio":"/audio/29a9abf3f4a74bd10c87.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"0e723d29b157aa0f","term":"녀석","zh":"家伙，小子","audio":"/audio/0e723d29b157aa0fccf9.mp3","entryId":"41586","definition":"(昵称)男孩子。","pronunciation":["녀석"]},{"id":"772813c770d7cbf8","term":"이마","zh":"额，前额，额头","audio":"/audio/772813c770d7cbf82ae4.mp3","entryId":"71693","definition":"指人脸眉毛以上、头发以下的部分。","pronunciation":["이마"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"真、确实（强调）","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"加强对某种状态的感叹；这里强调额头宽阔。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"宽阔舒展（这里形容额头）","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"宽阔舒展（这里形容额头）","pronunciation":["시원하다"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"长","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"人或事物的长相成为某种样子。","pronunciation":["생기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/12a76b835776aa93ac1b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71693-1-13-2","ko":"민준이가 이마 하나는 참 잘생겼죠.","zh":"敏俊的额头可真是好看呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준이：辅音结尾的人名“민준”后加 -이；-가 标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}},{"text":"이마","meaning":"额，前额，额头","explanation":"이마：额，前额，额头。","readings":[{"term":"이마","audio":"/audio/772813c770d7cbf82ae4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71693","senseId":"1","lemma":"이마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이마","audio":"/audio/772813c770d7cbf82ae4.mp3"}},{"text":"하나는","meaning":"单说额头","explanation":"하나：一个；이마 하나는 在这里突出“额头这一处”进行评价；-는 表示话题。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20283","senseId":"2","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나는","audio":"/audio/96dfc3407c61233001c6.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真、很","explanation":"참：真、很；加强对额头好看的赞叹。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"잘생겼죠.","meaning":"长得好看","explanation":"잘생기다：容貌好看；在这句中专门评价额头。-죠 礼貌地向对方确认或分享看法。","readings":[{"term":"잘생기다","audio":"/audio/c56f4bd1fb4139c5b3d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24881","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘생겼죠","audio":"/audio/64f37b6056d95ae55568.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"772813c770d7cbf8","term":"이마","zh":"额，前额，额头","audio":"/audio/772813c770d7cbf82ae4.mp3","entryId":"71693","definition":"指人脸眉毛以上、头发以下的部分。","pronunciation":["이마"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"一个、这一处","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20283","definition":"数目一；这里强调额头这一处长得好看。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真、很","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"加强程度；这里强调额头长得好看。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"c56f4bd1fb4139c5","term":"잘생기다","zh":"长得好看","audio":"/audio/c56f4bd1fb4139c5b3d2.mp3","entryId":"24881","definition":"形貌好看；这里形容额头的形状。","pronunciation":["잘생기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e96c429e27b1ad4d8dcb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.97,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71693","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"sequenceScore":1.6234,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那家伙的额头长得真够宽的啊。","敏俊的额头可真是好看呢。","第三张专辑卖得好吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那家伙的额头长得真够宽的啊。","敏俊的额头可真是好看呢。","第三张专辑卖得好吗？"],"answer":1}]}
